<title>UK: DG Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark bond due April 2001.</title>
<headline>DG Hypo sets 1.0 billion mark bond due April 2001.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Commerzbank,</p>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DG HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.0	 MATURITY    17.ARP.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.665    PAY DATE   S14.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  22.5	LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    6	   SELL CONC  16.5	DENOMS (K)  1</p>
<p> NOTES	OEEFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 760.</p>
<p>		S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
